# Test: a nested block a compiled-out plugin owns names the build tag and both fixes
# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
#
# VALIDATES: spec-operator-errors-name-the-fix AC-10 (unknown field). ze-stripped
# is built with "ze_core ze_ssh", so fib is present and fib-vpp (ze_vpp) is not.
# `fib { vpp { } }` is refused with the plugin line and a fix line naming
# ze_vpp or removing the block; `fib { vppqx { } }` keeps the typo hint.
# The unknown-backend half of AC-10 (`backend vpp`) is refused at validate by
# its ConfigNeed (test/ui/ze-stripped-optional-provider.ci); LoadBackend's own
# refusal is TestLoadBackendCompiledOutNamesTag.
#
# PREVENTS: `unknown field in fib: vpp` with no tag, so the operator cannot
# tell a typo from a missing feature.

tmpfs=fib-vpp.conf:terminator=EOF_FIB_VPP
fib {
    vpp {
    }
}
EOF_FIB_VPP

tmpfs=fib-typo.conf:refused=config-parse:terminator=EOF_FIB_TYPO
fib {
    vppqx {
    }
}
EOF_FIB_TYPO

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture ui/config-compiled-out-feature-names-tag:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=compiled-out nested block names ze_vpp; typo names no tag
